    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with a clear focal point in **Jackson Merrill**, who anchors our lineup with a 75.268 score. Facing Brandon Pfaadt, **Merrill** benefits from a favorable SP_xERA of 4.50 and, crucially, a slow-delivery pitcher who creates an opportunistic environment for his elite stolen base profile. **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** remains our highest-floor option at 70.86, primarily due to a premium matchup against Cristian Javier, whose 5.27 xERA signals significant vulnerability. While **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** carries a strong 69.72 score against McGreevy, his production is bolstered specifically by the dynamic platoon advantage we\u2019ve identified, effectively neutralizing the drag of an #8 lineup position.\n\nOur bench strategy today is largely dictated by scheduled off-days for core contributors like **Gunnar Henderson**, **Luis Robert Jr.**, and **Jorge Polanco**, alongside the ongoing injury status of **Jordan Westburg**. **Heliot Ramos** (54.19) and **Nasim Nunez** (50.95) occupy the lower end of our starting rotation today; while **Nunez** lacks the explosive ceiling of our top-tier starters, his inclusion is prioritized to maintain our stolen base pacing against an average pitcher in Aaron Nola. **Kyle Tucker** (65.35) remains a locked start despite the neutral platoon environment against Matthew Boyd, as his base projection consistently outperforms the situational upside of our remaining depth pieces like **Drake Baldwin**, **Jacob Wilson**, or **Sam Antonacci**. \n\nWe must remain vigilant regarding the \"Lineup Pending\" status for **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, **Nasim Nunez**, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, **Jackson Merrill**, **Andy Pages**, **Heliot Ramos**, and **Kyle Tucker**. While our modeling assumes standard order placement, any late-scratch or shift to the bottom of the order could compress the scores for **Nunez** and **Garc\u00eda Jr.**, potentially pushing them below our 50-point start threshold. We are monitoring these lineups closely; if these configurations hold, we expect steady accumulation across all five categories, with an aggressive focus on exploiting the defensive deficiencies of Pfaadt and Javier.",
